# Keyboard-first controls and session answer size

Status: DONE
Milestone: Explicit keyboard interaction and answer readability
Dependencies: 44_TRANSCRIPT_CLICK_SELECTION.todo, 47_ANSWER_FONT_SIZE.todo, 51_AUDIO_DEVICE_CARDS.todo, 56_MASK_ICON_POSITION.todo

## Purpose

Implement the October9 19:36 approval so the owner can try keyboard-first comfort, without
cursor locking/hiding/warping, global letter capture or automatic recording/submission.

## Completed scope

- [x] Ctrl+Alt+K / Keys activation; local Control, Select, Edit, Read, Command, Search, Devices and Help.
- [x] Stable segment cursor, j/k/arrows, Space multi-toggle, G/gg, source filters and local search.
  Enter reviews; Ctrl+Enter explicitly submits once. Manual corrections and clarification locks survive.
- [x] Literal Edit with Enter newlines, clipboard shortcuts and normal typing. Async interpretation
  follows the visible editable reply/original target only while this app remains foreground.
- [x] Escape backs out through Control and attempts PID-checked previous-window focus restoration.
  Mask disarms while existing audio and answers continue; ordinary modes do not cancel work.
- [x] Finite typed commands, bounded arguments and safe errors; no shell/model command interpretation.
  Device arrows/pages navigate independently; Space selects; capture locks and source identity remain.
- [x] Strict restart-loaded shortcut JSON, A-Z except E or F1-F11, fixed Ctrl+Alt+NoRepeat.
  Invalid settings disable only the shortcut with a visible notice; Keys remains the fallback.
- [x] Answer/interpretation Size slider8-24, Read +/- and :font. User choice survives resize for this
  session only; automatic9compact/10normal defaults remain until explicitly chosen.
- [x] Compact Select/Search borrows transcript reading space; other compact modes/large fonts prioritize
  Q/A without invoking close/cancel. Existing wide columns and background activity are preserved.
- [x] Reviewed code corrections, synthetic regressions, current images, source explanations,
  one-shot citations, full source-atlas/handbook HTML/PDF and bounded local handoff.

