- Full atlas and handbook editions built; new chapter, PDF pages, atlas search and browser widths
  1440/768/390 inspected. Exact generated counts/hashes belong to their manifests.

## Qualification boundaries

No real audio/model request, cursor operation, new ZIP, app restart, commit or push.
Actual shortcut collisions, foreground return, non-US layouts, accessibility, owner comfort and
recipient capture/cursor behavior remain unqualified. Synthetic device-busy evidence is bounded;
it is not a hardware-device qualification. Docker remains the separate optional final-stage task.

